"eli5": "$\\Delta G$ is the reaction's \"want to.\" Negative $\\Delta G$ = the reaction rolls downhill on its own. Two things help it roll: releasing heat ($\\Delta H < 0$) and making things messier ($\\Delta S > 0$). Temperature decides how much the mess counts.",
